  triage:title "reject_remote_core_ack re-decides local-vs-remote via raw remote_host.is_some() check instead of the shared route_send_request classifier" ;
  triage:description "reject_remote_core_ack (crates/atm-core/src/ack/mod.rs) re-decides local-vs-remote routing via a raw `prepared.reply_request.remote_host.is_some()` check instead of calling the shared route_send_request classifier used by execute_ack_reply_plan a few hundred lines below in the same file -- a second place answering the same routing question. Same family as AG18-QA-003 / CROSSHOST-UNIFY-3 (duplicate local/remote dispatch-fork pattern)." ;
